  },
  data: {
    LLM: "Deal 3 cards each and 4 face up on the table. Non-dealer plays first. Each turn play one card: either capture a set of table cards that with the played card total 15 (capture is compulsory when possible), or trail the card face up on the table. Clearing the table scores a scopa (1 pt). After all have played their three cards, deal 3 more each; repeat until deck is exhausted. Last captor takes any remaining table cards. Dealer's final card never scores a scopa. Scoring as basic Scopa.",
    Player: "Deal 3 cards each and 4 face up on the table. Non-dealer plays first. Each turn play one card: either capture a set of table cards that with the played card total 15 (capture is compulsory when possible), or trail the card face up on the table. Clearing the table scores a scopa (1 pt). After all have played their three cards, deal 3 more each; repeat until deck is exhausted. Last captor takes any remaining table cards. Dealer's final card never scores a scopa. Scoring as basic Scopa.",
    objective: 'Capture cards from the table by playing a card that together with one or more table cards sums to 15. Score points for sweeps (scopa), most cards, most coins, settebello (7 of coins), and best primiera. First to 11 or agreed target wins.',
    gameplay: "Deal 3 cards each and 4 face up on the table. Non-dealer plays first. Each turn play one card: either capture a set of table cards that with the played card total 15 (capture is compulsory when possible), or trail the card face up on the table. Clearing the table scores a scopa (1 pt). After all have played their three cards, deal 3 more each; repeat until deck is exhausted. Last captor takes any remaining table cards. Dealer's final card never scores a scopa. Scoring as basic Scopa.",
    keyRules: [
      'Quindici',
      'Capture only when played card plus table cards sum to 15 (first version); some variants allow equal-value capture too.',
      'Three or four Kings in initial table layout: redeal.',
    ],
